{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f62f62e6e7de9693e086b56ebf8fe27f19fcfb1eed3092a75e2f427cd29958d1f0ad03cce42ae21fa9d413d10623b66f6914b647c42a4d7069bca40d7d9ddbddbc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/34b124a14b2f4fc72d6dccbc1850ac0fc36ebf2e745577104ff6757cf01ac78851606ff138ffce45130718f5e1d87a6bf86b0c9cc4f49f34e7148e8695d7939fdabb6a161cc9e22948e0444c3fcd04\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/623e5c1b1a00f940b333bb3f018637b8ec41a99773d0bfbd23010e15654b136642e00dd0b7b599c7049e20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8bb932d9fe62371681d7ba9a7037bd047fc5e2e2f714a0d80df3a7d27d2cfb7032e60eb0ff525bfbf2d058349b9db3f8e7bb95e44d6cdab056a987d122724d034a91cdd2a766dfc2e290baaba65231\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/45bb65cc674b9afe23789cba4cd5a114808974f80fd07786b3c3952d648df9d687c5b0562bd12f91c1c631adbbab0522d5d79ce239c911214bfdab64281a4e9624931df32f622917123ae9d261b5d2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f108d1cf8f39963db2d319dfd3f3bdc42f014ceee6885d5428ada5765ab52a0f3c0d0247744c414f46cb9701c13bf7d83833d99031bf780793e4d3a113e0c170ebf59a174ec4271f8b200989dd6d63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1697a5037dcc1eb1db37c052f1cd071ab10628297024127f4af8d4f00d1b5e21c9cbb5b18195067b32d347d3ff6b69611da794c1523c6451a812ba947ade669dbfa8d68d3ab6c7386e3562ba3f2293\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0f36e67367becb62db804b80efba3a021eefadccb11689a9145e090e78bb8acdd2780c0fe46bd3404fdee6b8a4248a4ca23181ab0c9c64acd2098c5060b3e1dfcbdb8a580eb6915667dfc88ed77f12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5ff02d463623c06bbbda28ae9615f8cf5024d93ae307bc8632ca4d3ae5db08d5c69e64cb532afe2d0186c0b7caed640b855db76834c1bcc9815414e8e28c9553399a3e08fe2d5629c9e0db90b5384a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2a7fc6f8641545f16abfc121a318a7ceb89daecfb0f6b7cc808bcb034a5fa7337cda54110c29928b825ace3492ed87f76ecfd2ad0076e270b990e6ed31e9af3a9d022467dcb0abb1527d52352d0166\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/723d28de0022d0d8c47206cc11eba51aceae5e089f9a17a85bfdbd2d7953a976a39289d312ad9213282fc2370d4fb6a3aa3d9c3095c0e8c68283c8a0a89d0b8f158e66016121dd19579bcde43b763b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/46ae19710d1754664afae61efb948bb26bcc9bcb6e7f8c0123cf80ca2ffe0225de02bfba92d368d04378875b8e6171b6dccd4de00a07b37ec4a3516324a3393910ade512298cb5d9be936382365d84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1a83e5379125b7289971ada1608ff861b48f531c96ae38da16377a667e0398bebd528addd9933d90d78ec4190e9ba92d79c1bca24f52ce7c96d7c6af06185c5a9381c6278210d065c2170781695946\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c9cf81bb19d048b8f7f9161ebb182deff9490d0e09cd9e61467385333eb58cfb0f881c5e1d94b80d314034c060434eb38ab263ab3f467cd2b5c5b04c0d3f474403b19a4e3fc3a399dab87f629b71b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ce266f901c1e85cc43b994567319e1dbe700d3a91413877da1cb1fac18a345eaadb44a9fcb21f1f2e93d73963f9179d0fe4ca37403415e9740e8ab08e600c70daa3c312f7e393d77e09e194aa5720b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/657999e1abeab8cdcdcd114e6f053d55ca0b8938b8dc9d0ce935a0eb81b926c4217978794ee2b1d371d7376de21a27a2db1f88768db5456a272e88c4ad059c865f8c2dd60e3ee5f4ec0e8d175ed447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/de26c1cb8379f7b90477bfe7d76a9a5026ede737cc1a6839cbcfaf2da1e50ccff12cada26f8a73ce8ed235da7348789267c4c1e980784698bc96a0e2df8c5c1af544cea20215d1ced1ffc0f668a866\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/412aa13c1207be1312e722cfea53e328d072049d54d4c48ee74f67dfe1d27dbdee4bdf8134056c48d6d280d56dbc37741d45255afd363d9af3aef973088fc1af3022aef8935f5f76e2a86da66c8ba0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/401320b1f80d165cec0be34def48990e6d77ef1f5fc036153e7aac0bd11c3ffc3d991d2e37c3083e404cde706f96adf244b609b3166deda6af13ab6f34078818c958dd7848d1f7a775b2e54e7074d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5169ccdc1b9220ae8a92497a284aa375147c4f89681d349cfa7de1d543276c20847323f789bf98249c525c88b6fada11eb6f4d1f7e0f0737a2b92f322d886afea682c4e3d13f2dc168e20ff3c6f612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
